Library Management System Project

Project Title: Library Management System

Objective:
To automate library operations such as managing books, students, book issuing, and returns.

Modules
Admin Module
Add, update, delete books
Manage student records
View issued books
Student Module
Search books
View available books
Check issued books and due dates
Book Issue & Return Module
Issue books to students
Return books
Calculate late fines
Technologies Used
Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
Backend: Python (Flask/Django) or Java
Database: MySQL
Database Tables
Table	Purpose
Books	Store book details
Students	Store student details
Issue_Books	Track issued books
Returns	Track returned books
Main Features
User Login Authentication
Add/Edit/Delete Books
Search Books
Issue & Return Books
Fine Calculation
Generate Reports
